{"id":"0f6dbde032017491","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-step-notation.md","title":"73-df-pda-step-notation — pda step notation","display":"73-df-pda-step-notation — pda step notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-step-notation","display":"73-df-pda-step-notation — pda step notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-notation]]","[[73-df-pda-configuration-notation]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"aliases":["73-df-pda-step-notation","73-definition-5.3"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-step-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-pda-step-notation — pda step notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a436382200a93b34\" href=\"?note=a436382200a93b34\" title=\"73-df-pda-notation\">73-df-pda-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a0932e23b6a3de2\" href=\"?note=9a0932e23b6a3de2\" title=\"73-df-pda-configuration-notation\">73-df-pda-configuration-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-step-notation</span><span>73-definition-5.3</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\)</span>，配置见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a0932e23b6a3de2\" href=\"?note=9a0932e23b6a3de2\" title=\"73-df-pda-configuration-notation\">73-df-pda-configuration-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RTC}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RTC}(R)\\)</span> 在本文件固定载集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Config}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Config}_M\\)</span> 上解释为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,aw,X\\beta)\\land C&#39;=(p,w,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,aw,X\\beta)\\land C&#39;=(p,w,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RTC}(R)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R),\\qquad\n\\vdash_M^*\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RTC}(\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M^2:C\\vdash_M C&#39;\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RTC}(R)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R),\\qquad\n\\vdash_M^*\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RTC}(\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M^2:C\\vdash_M C&#39;\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用存在分解式，避免同一输入/输出配置对的不同栈后缀分解被误当作彼此独立的等价定义。空栈没有可弹出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，故没有一步后继。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation","status":"resolved","id":"9a0932e23b6a3de2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-configuration-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation","status":"resolved","id":"9a0932e23b6a3de2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}$，配置见 [[73-df-pda-configuration-notation]]；$C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RTC}(R)$ 在本文件固定载集 $\\mathrm{Config}_M$ 上解释为 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]] 的 $\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}","display":false},{"tex":"C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RTC}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Config}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M C'\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,p\\in Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\exists X\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\;\n(C=(q,aw,X\\beta)\\land C'=(p,w,\\gamma\\beta)\\land(p,\\gamma)\\in\\delta(q,a,X))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RTC}(R)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R),\\qquad\n\\vdash_M^*\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RTC}(\\{(C,C')\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M^2:C\\vdash_M C'\\})","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1401,"backlinks":[{"id":"78740429e7dc7250","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}$；有限步关系见 [[73-df-pda-step-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["a436382200a93b34","9a0932e23b6a3de2","25902d0bd75ea963"]}